# YouTube Tags & SEO Optimization 
In addition to specific topics, you should include "meta" keywords that describe the format and nature of your channel to
help the algorithm categorize your library.
- Channel Tags: Education, Life Skills, Human Experience, Personal Transformation, Masterclass, Documentary,
